E0056 (https://starstream.nightstream.dev/errors/E0056)

  x pattern expects a tuple with 2 elements but scrutinee has type `i64`
   ,-[test.star:2:11]
 1 | fn test(value: i64) -> i64 {
 2 |     match value {
   :           ^^^|^^
   :              `-- has type `i64`
 3 |         (a, b) => {
   :         ^^^|^^^
   :            `-- has type `(t3, t4)`
 4 |             a
   `----
